    "text": "For one mole of a van der Waal's gas when $b=0$ and $\\mathrm{T}=300 \\mathrm{~K}$, the PV vs, $1 / \\mathrm{V}$ plot is shown below. The value of the van der Waal's constant $a$ (atm. liter ${ }^{2} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-2}$ ) is :\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ku8zTykkOmVuLrktWg0WPWEVa-Uh5hX9VUAXejmzkQw.original.fullsize.png\">",
