  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ItJQAEDeaZBHL2jFz1iqa2hE-Mq_z--QqMX1p93C-Ro.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\left(P+\\frac{\\mathrm{a}}{V^{2}}\\right)(V)=R T \\\\\r\n\r\nP V+a / V=R T ; P V=R T-a(V) \\\\\r\n\r\ny=R T-a(x)\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$\r\n\r\nSo, slope $=a=\\frac{21.6-20.1}{3-2}=\\frac{1.5}{1}=1.5$",
